llm_review_history.suggested_corrections:
Split the a_gt_steps into two sequential steps: first step containing the Get Event Data call, second step containing the Create Event call. Example correction:
{
  "q": "Find Education details and create an event to discuss the results.",
  "a_gt_steps": [
    {
      "tool_calls": [
        {
          "tool_name": "Get Event Data",
          "arguments": {
            "eventName": "classes",
            "date": "2025-08-15"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tool_calls": [
        {
          "tool_name": "Create Event",
          "arguments": {
            "agent": "Sherwood Ford",
            "eventInfoStr1": "Discuss class results",
            "phoneNum": "5551234567",
            "eventName": "class discussion"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "o_gt": "I retrieved the class details for 2025-08-15 and created a new event called 'class discussion' to discuss those results."
}
